        "text_tNNyqd": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Over the past few years, adhesive tapes have become increasingly popular in the construction industry. Building professionals have begun to turn to innovative products that save time and money on the construction site. Adhesive tapes reduce installation and drying times and deliver other benefits as well. For example, they can save money on installation costs, provide improved air sealing, energy efficiency, and more.</p><p>There are many applications for adhesive tapes on construction sites both within a structure’s interior and around the exterior, and many types of construction tapes exist that provide solutions for this industry. Builders and contractors should be well informed on the different types of tapes that exist, so their construction projects can be performed most efficiently.</p>",
