          }
        },
        "text_FM3hVa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Adhesive tape products are widely used throughout the construction and building industries in both interior and exterior applications. All types of building professionals, from contractors to engineers and architects, choose NADCO for their adhesive solutions. The adhesive tapes that we provide are suitable for numerous construction applications, such as:</p><ul><li>Bonding and mounting window and door parts</li><li>Bonding and mounting decorative trims</li><li>Bonding elevator or escalator components</li><li>Bonding frames to panels</li><li>Bonding decorative wall coverings and attractive facades</li><li>Bonding solar modules</li><li>Mirror mounting</li><li>Window glazing</li><li>Glass mounting</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
