        },
        "text_fLdEcn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO delivers exceptional quality on a wide selection of adhesive tapes that benefit the construction industry. Our 35,000 sq. ft. warehouse and state-of-the-art equipment allow us to directly manufacture the tapes our customers need, including any desired customization. We meet all industry standards and regulations, which ensure that our tapes meet the continually evolving needs of the construction industry.</p><p>Many types of tape are utilized by the construction industry due to their highly durable nature and versatility. These tapes not only perform well in long-term applications but also are quick to install and cost-effective.</p><p>NADCO offers fully customizable solutions for adhesive tape products with reduced lead times and consistent product quality. To learn more about how we can serve you, contact us today.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
